    Bug 1900790 - Add mailTabs.getSelectedFolders() and ensure correct values for "selected" folders in the menus API. r=aleca


    This adds the discussed method `mailTabs.getSelectedFolders()`, which
    always returns the actual selected folders in the folder pane. The
    menus API has been adjusted to always return the folders, which should
    be acted upon by the context action (which might just be the clicked
    folder, if it is not part of the current selection), following
    Thunderbirds own UI.

    Adding a test to verify both behaviors.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D212688

